# Files that belong in the repository but not in a Vercel deployment.
#
# Vercel uploads the whole repo unless told otherwise. Nothing below is imported
# by the Next.js app, so excluding it keeps each build's upload small without
# changing what runs.

# The PyTorch disease classifier. It is a separate FastAPI service that has to
# be hosted somewhere with a persistent process and ~100MB of model weights —
# Vercel's serverless functions are neither. Point INFERENCE_URL at wherever it
# runs; without it the scanner falls back to the Groq vision model on its own.
/ml/

# Project documentation. Read on GitHub, never served by the app.
/docs/

# Local-only tooling: SQL migrations are applied with scripts/db-exec.mjs from a
# developer machine, and the image/validation scripts are build-time helpers
# whose output is already committed.
/scripts/

# Supabase config + SQL migrations — applied out of band, never read at runtime.
/supabase/

# Internal concept documents (also gitignored).
*.docx

# Security notes — read on GitHub, not served by the app.
/SECURITY.md

# Working material (also gitignored — listed here in case a clone still has it).
/Screenshots/
/team images/
